{"id":782,"name":"jangmo-o","speciesId":782,"dex":782,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["dragon"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":55,"defense":65,"special-attack":45,"special-defense":45,"speed":45},"abilities":[{"name":"bulletproof","hidden":false},{"name":"soundproof","hidden":false},{"name":"overcoat","hidden":true}],"height":6,"weight":297,"baseExp":60,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/782.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/782.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/782.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/782.ogg","genus":"Scaly Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon escamoso","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"It expresses its feelings by smacking its scales. Metallic sounds echo through the tall mountains where Jangmo-o lives."},{"version":"moon","text":"They live in mountains where no trace of humans can be detected. Jangmo-o grow little by little as they battle one another."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It smacks the scales on its head against rocks or against the ground to frighten its opponents. It can also contact its friends with these noises."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It will never show an enemy its back in battle. Ancient warriors liked Jangmo-o for its valiant disposition and made it one of their own."},{"version":"sword","text":"They learn to fight by smashing their head scales together. The dueling strengthens both their skills and their spirits."},{"version":"shield","text":"Jangmo-o strikes its scales to communicate with others of its kind. Its scales are actually fur that’s become as hard as metal."}],"flavorPt":"Jangmo-o atinge suas escamas para se comunicar com outros de sua espécie. Suas escamas são na verdade pêlos que se tornaram tão duros quanto metal.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":4